Subject: [PATCH] Add a few BZ entries to NEWS

BZ 17142
BZ 31026
BZ 31877
BZ 34313
BZ 34360
BZ 34428
BZ 34437
BZ 34574
BZ 34600
BZ 34697
BZ 34989
