 NEWS | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)

diff --git a/NEWS b/NEWS
index b3fcaba1..02d30961 100644
--- a/NEWS
+++ b/NEWS
@@ -14,9 +14,21 @@ Deprecated and removed features, and other changes affecting compatibility:
 
 The following bugs are resolved with this release:
 
+  [17142] locale: LANGUAGE environment variable processing and directory
+    traversal
+  [31026] network: Reachable assertion in resolv_conf.c:570:
+    update_from_conf: Assertion `resolv_conf_matches (resp, conf)'
+  [31877] libc: elf/tst-shstk-legacy-1g test failure on znver4
   [33085] libc: nftw: readdir() errors are ignored
+  [34313] libc: Erroneous nonnull attributes for fchmodat, faccessat,
+    and fchownat
   [34338] libc: Cancellable syscall wrappers are missing from backtraces
     because they tail-call __syscall_cancel
+  [34360] dynamic-link: TOCTOU race condition in processing RPATH with
+    $ORIGIN DST for setuid/setgid binaries (CVE-2026-86805)
+  [34428] dynamic-link: ldd -u prints Relink `' with `/lib64/libc.so.6'
+  [34437] libc: posix_spawn_file_actions_addchdir and
+    posix_spawn_file_actions_addfchdir not available as exported
   [34438] build: non reproducible build failure: sigaltstack-offsets.h:
     No such file or directory
   [34439] build: parallel make install fails on multi-ABI targets: no
@@ -28,6 +40,12 @@ The following bugs are resolved with this release:
     cross-testing without python3 on target
   [34509] libc: [m68k] Regression: Perl locks up after upgrading glibc
     to 2.43
+  [34574] stdio: Buffer overflow in fopen ,ccs= argument processing
+    (CVE-2026-18374)
+  [34600] dynamic-link: [2.44 regression] ld.so segfaults at startup
+    with an old-format ld.so.cache
+  [34697] malloc: Corrupted trailing content on realloc of mmap
+    allocation but mremap failed
   [34699] build: Parallel build failures with make check xcheck
   [34734] libc: sparc: tcgetattr returns uninitialized bytes in c_cc[17]
     and c_cc[18]
@@ -52,6 +70,10 @@ The following bugs are resolved with this release:
     incremental builds
   [34966] dynamic-link: Static dlopen fail in elf/tst-ptrguard-static-
     dlopen
+  [34989] stdio: stdio: Wide scanf %s and %[ write an extra null byte
+    past the destination (CVE-2026-115819)
+  [34991] regex: regex: double free after partial realloc failure
+    (CVE-2026-100290)
 
 Version 2.44
 
